      Whatever route you choose, the same rule holds: the certificate is the entry ticket, not the plan. The
      professionals winning right now are the ones who paired a credential with one real, documented, explainable
      piece of work — building the <strong>high-value skill portfolio</strong> that actually unlocks
      <strong>high income opportunities</strong>, not the ones who simply collected the most badges.
    </p>
  </div>

