  <h2 id="verdict">The verdict framework: not a flat yes or no</h2>

  <p>
    "Is cybersecurity a good career" does not have one correct answer for everyone. It has a correct answer for
    your specific fit, budget, and target lane. Use this framework instead of a single verdict.
